<title>USA: Carpinteria USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec.</title>
<headline>Carpinteria USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities Inc., said it won $4 million of Carpinteria USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, 1995 Election, Series C, with a true interest cost of 5.71 percent.</p>
</text>
